<mxfile host="drawio" agent="scaling_build.py" version="24.7.0"><diagram id="scale" name="Масштабирование"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1320" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1320" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t1" value="&lt;b&gt;Мини-облако: горизонтальное масштабирование&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1500" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t2" value="ПР4. Копии API и фоновых обработчиков не хранят состояния, поэтому их можно добавлять и убирать. Всё состояние живёт в PostgreSQL, Garage и Redis" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4D5B6B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="54" width="1500" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3" value="" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#08427B;strokeColor=#073B6F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="745" y="92" width="90" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b4" value="&lt;b style='font-size:15px'&gt;Пользователи и гости&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;[Люди]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px'&gt;PWA в браузере и на телефоне; access-токен в памяти вкладки, refresh в cookie&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#08427B;strokeColor=#073B6F;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="160" width="240" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bound" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 6;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="340" width="1520" height="760" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t5" value="&lt;b&gt;Мини-облако&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#555555' style='font-size:11px'&gt;[Программная система, сервер в одном дата-центре]&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="46" y="1050" width="600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b6" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="380" width="460" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b7" value="&lt;b style='font-size:15px'&gt;Балансировщик ×2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;[Nginx, общий IP через keepalived]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px'&gt;TLS, статика PWA, ограничение частоты по IP. Раздаёт запросы копиям API, запросы к s3.minicloud.example проксирует в Garage. Липкие сессии не нужны&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="390" width="460" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b8" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="600" width="400" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b9" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130" y="610" width="400" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b10" value="&lt;b style='font-size:15px'&gt;API ×N&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;[Python 3.13, FastAPI, Uvicorn]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px'&gt;Без состояния: подпись JWT проверяется в памяти, без похода в базу. Любой запрос на любую копию; упала одна, запросы уходят на другие&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="620" width="400" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b11" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="610" width="400" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b12" value="&lt;b style='font-size:15px'&gt;Фоновый обработчик ×M&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;[Python 3.13, Procrastinate]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px'&gt;Без состояния: задачи и события берёт из PostgreSQL, одну задачу забирает один обработчик. Рассылка событий, проверка отпечатка, превью, корзина&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="620" width="400" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b13" value="&lt;b style='font-size:15px'&gt;Redis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;[Счётчики в памяти]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px'&gt;Счётчики попыток входа и частоты запросов с TTL, общие для всех копий API. Потеря не страшна&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E7BC4;strokeColor=#2A6CAD;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="860" width="250" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b14" value="&lt;b style='font-size:15px'&gt;PostgreSQL 18, основной&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;[База данных]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px'&gt;Схема на контекст, сеансы входа, загрузки, журнал событий, очередь задач. Растёт сначала вверх&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E7BC4;strokeColor=#2A6CAD;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="850" width="300" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b15" value="&lt;b style='font-size:15px'&gt;PostgreSQL, реплика&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;[Горячий резерв]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px'&gt;Потоковая репликация; при отказе основного становится основным&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E7BC4;strokeColor=#2A6CAD;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="870" width="240" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b16" value="" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E7BC4;strokeColor=#2A6CAD;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1144" y="826" width="330" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b17" value="" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E7BC4;strokeColor=#2A6CAD;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1132" y="838" width="330" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b18" value="&lt;b style='font-size:15px'&gt;Garage ×3 узла&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;[Файловое хранилище, S3 API]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px'&gt;replication_factor = 3: каждый объект на трёх узлах. Узлы добавляются без остановки, данные перераспределяются&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E7BC4;strokeColor=#2A6CAD;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="850" width="330" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b19" value="&lt;b style='font-size:15px'&gt;Хранилище резервных копий&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:11px'&gt;[Внешняя система]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px'&gt;S3-совместимое хранилище в другом дата-центре&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#999999;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="1170" width="460" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e20" value="&lt;b&gt;Работают с файлами&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[HTTPS]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b4" target="b7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e21" value="&lt;b&gt;/api/v1, least_conn&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[HTTP]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b7" target="b10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e22" value="&lt;b&gt;s3.minicloud.example:&lt;br&gt;части файла, мимо API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[HTTP]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b7" target="b18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1530" y="455"/><mxPoint x="1530" y="945"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e23" value="&lt;b&gt;INCR и EXPIRE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[RESP]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.15;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b10" target="b13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e24" value="&lt;b&gt;SQL, короткие транзакции&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[TCP 5432]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.6;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b10" target="b14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e25" value="&lt;b&gt;ListParts, CompleteMultipartUpload&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[S3 API]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.4;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b10" target="b18"><mxGeometry x="0.55" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="560" y="725"/><mxPoint x="560" y="815"/><mxPoint x="1250" y="815"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e26" value="&lt;b&gt;задачи и события, LISTEN/NOTIFY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[SQL]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.67;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b12" target="b14"><mxGeometry x="-0.35" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="990" y="725"/><mxPoint x="990" y="790"/><mxPoint x="580" y="790"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e27" value="&lt;b&gt;проверка, превью, удаление&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[S3 API]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.85;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.85;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b12" target="b18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" value="&lt;b&gt;WAL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[репликация]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b14" target="b15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e29" value="&lt;b&gt;WAL-архив&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[WAL-G]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.065;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b14" target="b19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e30" value="&lt;b&gt;ночная копия бакетов&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[rclone]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#707070;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b18" target="b19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1285" y="1225"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="lgbox" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#F7F9FC;strokeColor=#8A9BB0;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1130" width="430" height="205" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t31" value="&lt;b&gt;Обозначения&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="1140" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg0" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#08427B;strokeColor=#08427B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="58" y="1170" width="50" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t32" value="Люди" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="122" y="1172" width="330" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg1" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#438DD5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="58" y="1202" width="50" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t33" value="Без состояния: копии добавляются свободно" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="122" y="1204" width="330" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg2" value="" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2E7BC4;strokeColor=#2E7BC4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="58" y="1234" width="50" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t34" value="Хранит состояние" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="122" y="1236" width="330" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg3" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#999999;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="58" y="1266" width="50" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t35" value="Внешняя система" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="122" y="1268" width="330" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t36" value="«×N» и стопка: несколько одинаковых копий" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4D5B6B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="58" y="1302" width="400" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>